        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-02-14T03:46:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this is something we might have to live with ? The user can uninstall the package so we need to have this ability technically ; if the app receives, say, a kill switch due to a found vulnerability, maybe we want to honor a request to down the VPN.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2880,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 2881,
        "endChar": 28
      },
      "revId": "c80c7695ce9dfbab093366e712f8ca110d0ed996",
